"""
Phase 8.4 — Dynamic RAG Document Planner

Input
-----
storage/organized_knowledge/<domain>/knowledge_units.json

Output
------
storage/organized_knowledge/<domain>/rag_plan.json

Purpose
-------
Convert detailed 8.3 taxonomy buckets into a manageable, dynamic set
of large RAG documents.

Important
---------
This phase DOES NOT:
- use an LLM
- summarize
- rewrite knowledge
- chunk
- embed
- create vectors
- create DOCX

It ONLY:
- groups knowledge units
- preserves provenance
- preserves hierarchy
- guarantees zero useful-unit loss
- dynamically determines the final document set

Design
------
8.3 has a detailed taxonomy.

8.4 deliberately has a coarser document-family layer.

Therefore:

    taxonomy category
            ↓
    document family
            ↓
    final RAG document

The final document count is NOT fixed.
20-30 is a practical target range, not a hard constraint.
"""


